  },
  "content": {
    "chapters": [
      {
        "number": 1,
        "title": "",
        "beats": [
          {
            "text": "The Gambler, by Fyodor Dostoyevsky.",
            "beat_type": "book_title_announcement",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "Chapter One.",
            "beat_type": "chapter_announcement",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "At length I returned from two weeks leave of absence to find that my patrons had arrived three days ago in Roulettenberg.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "I received from them a welcome quite different to that which I had expected.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "The General eyed me coldly, greeted me in rather haughty fashion, and dismissed me to pay my respects to his sister.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "I was assigned a small room on the fourth floor of the hotel, for you must know that I belonged to the General's suite.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "Finally his anger exploded, and he added sharply:",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "I suppose you would like to take them to the Casino to play roulette? Well, excuse my speaking so plainly, but I know how addicted you are to gambling.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 2,
            "emotion": "sharp irritation"
          },
          {
            "text": "I have no money for gambling.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "quiet"
          },
          {
            "text": "I quietly replied.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "But you will soon be in receipt of some.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 2,
            "emotion": "retorting"
          },
          {
            "text": "Retorted the General.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "Let us calculate.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 2,
            "emotion": "businesslike"
          },
          {
            "text": "He went on.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "We must translate these roubles into thalers. Here, take 100 thalers, as a round sum. The rest will be safe in my hands.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 2,
            "emotion": "commanding"
          },
          {
            "text": "I accepted the money without a word, and then withdrew to my own room.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "On the way I met Polina Alexandrovna on the staircase.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "I have been waiting for you.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 3,
            "emotion": "quietly insistent"
          },
          {
            "text": "She said.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "Come to my room.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 3,
            "emotion": "quietly insistent"
          },
          {
            "text": "I followed her in silence.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          }
        ],
        "sfx_audio_paths": [],
        "music_audio_paths": []
      },
      {
        "number": 6,
        "title": "",
        "beats": [
          {
            "text": "Chapter Six.",
            "beat_type": "chapter_announcement",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "I stepped from the path into the carriage-way, and took my stand in the middle of it. There I awaited the Baron and the Baroness.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "When they were but a few paces distant from me I took off my hat, and bowed.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "Madame la Baronne.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "loud and distinct"
          },
          {
            "text": "Said I, loudly and distinctly.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "J'ai l'honneur d'être votre esclave.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "mock-formal"
          },
          {
            "text": "Hein!",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 2,
            "emotion": "angry surprise"
          },
          {
            "text": "Ejaculated, or rather growled, the Baron as he turned towards me in angry surprise.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "Ja wohl!",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "defiant"
          },
          {
            "text": "I replied, still looking him in the eyes.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "Sind Sie rasend?",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 2,
            "emotion": "furious"
          },
          {
            "text": "He exclaimed, brandishing his stick.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "I have perpetrated the piece of idiocy.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "matter-of-fact"
          },
          {
            "text": "I said as I came level with her.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "Have you? Then you can take the consequences.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 3,
            "emotion": "cold indifference"
          },
          {
            "text": "She replied without so much as looking at me.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "My good sir.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 4,
            "emotion": "strained politeness"
          },
          {
            "text": "The General began.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "May I ask you what this is that you have gone and done?",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 4,
            "emotion": "strained politeness"
          },
          {
            "text": "I should be glad.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "calm"
          },
          {
            "text": "I replied.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "If we could come straight to the point. Probably you are referring to my encounter of today with a German?",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "calm"
          },
          {
            "text": "With a German? Why, the German was the Baron Burmergelm, a most important personage! I hear that you have been rude both to him and to the Baroness?",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 4,
            "emotion": "indignant"
          },
          {
            "text": "No, I have not.",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "flat denial"
          },
          {
            "text": "I replied.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "For God's sake, Alexis Ivanovitch, do put an end to this senseless scheme of yours!",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 4,
            "emotion": "pleading"
          },
          {
            "text": "He muttered, but with a sudden change from a truculent tone to one of entreaty as he caught me by the hand.",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "With that he wound up in a despairing voice:",
            "beat_type": "narration",
            "character_id": 1,
            "emotion": "neutral"
          },
          {
            "text": "O Alexis Ivanovitch, Alexis Ivanovitch!",
            "beat_type": "dialogue",
            "character_id": 4,
            "emotion": "despairing"
          }
        ],
        "sfx_audio_paths": [],
        "music_audio_paths": []
      }
    ]
  },
